{"4066780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cool Story Bro!", "steam_appid": 4066780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Write short stories about 4 random words:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get 4 completely random words - like: <strong>Baguette. Insolvency. Grandpa. University<i> </i></strong>-<strong><i> </i></strong>and have to write a short story about them. Surprise your friends with creativity, chaos, or pure nonsense! If you’re feeling creative, you can also let the game assign you a random genre (like crime or romance)... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Use items to mess with your friends</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Write Phase, you can earn a variety of items by winning typeracer minigames. Use them to disrupt other players in creative ways - for example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>revolver</strong> to knock someone out for 10 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>story switch</strong> that forces you to continue another player’s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>letter lock</strong> that blocks specific keys for a short time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a fish that adds some fish to the story of another player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Type fast and have fun!</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rate the Stories:</u></strong> <br>When the writing timer ends, it’s showtime! Each player steps onto the stage and reads their masterpiece aloud...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Downvote</strong> = Bad</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upvote</strong> = Good</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or grab the <strong>rocket launcher</strong> and blow your friend up if you <i>really</i> hate the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer for 2-4 Players and a Singleplayer Mode where you can just freely write stories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and Private Rooms to play with your friends or with strangers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame Voicechat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch Integration: Your viewers choose the words and you have to write the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grandpas with Rocketlaunchers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for custom words: Let each Player submit 8 custom words and the game will pick 4 random ones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game saves every story and you can read them at anytime in the story collection in the home menu</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Write short stories about 4 random words:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get 4 completely random words - like: <strong>Baguette. Insolvency. Grandpa. University<i> </i></strong>-<strong><i> </i></strong>and have to write a short story about them. Surprise your friends with creativity, chaos, or pure nonsense! If you’re feeling creative, you can also let the game assign you a random genre (like crime or romance)... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/2694712d780a74399d483ef358688a67.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Use items to mess with your friends</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Write Phase, you can earn a variety of items by winning typeracer minigames. Use them to disrupt other players in creative ways - for example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>revolver</strong> to knock someone out for 10 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>story switch</strong> that forces you to continue another player’s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>letter lock</strong> that blocks specific keys for a short time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a fish that adds some fish to the story of another player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Type fast and have fun!</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/03c9a6216a23f9edbb40b4c917b8b2b5.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rate the Stories:</u></strong> <br>When the writing timer ends, it’s showtime! Each player steps onto the stage and reads their masterpiece aloud...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Downvote</strong> = Bad</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upvote</strong> = Good</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or grab the <strong>rocket launcher</strong> and blow your friend up if you <i>really</i> hate the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.poster.avif?t=1775826219\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.webm?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066780/extras/d2ee8ceeebe69036ef09972945eacb0b.mp4?t=1775826219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer for 2-4 Players and a Singleplayer Mode where you can just freely write stories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and Private Rooms to play with your friends or with strangers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame Voicechat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch Integration: Your viewers choose the words and you have to write the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grandpas with Rocketlaunchers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for custom words: Let each Player submit 8 custom words and the game will pick 4 random ones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game saves every story and you can read them at anytime in the story collection in the home menu</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cool Story Bro! is a chaotic 2 - 4 player party game where you write short stories based on 4 random words. Vote for the most creative masterpiece, sabotage your friends with items, survive unexpected game-changing events… and if you really hate someone’s story? Just... Blow. Them. Up!", "sup